# inc-g045 phase 3: the Learn Spells table's Enter summary box.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/human-priest-mage-dual-seed4-gate.sav \
#   INCURSION_RUN_DIR=logs/inc-g045-p3 \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/learn-table-summary.keys 4
#
# The route reaches the table exactly as tools/keys/spell-tags.keys does: 's'
# for one real turn, 'm' then ESC for the cast menu, 'd' for the character
# sheet and 'L' for Learn Spells. On the level 1 page the cursor starts on row
# 0 (Endure Cold, a "[ ]" row). Before it can be marked the level must have a
# free slot, so the cursor goes DOWN 6 to the Memorized "Protection from Evil
# (Arcane)" row and SPACE unmarks it (3 of 3 -> 2 of 3). UP 6 returns to row 0
# and SPACE marks Endure Cold. Enter now draws the summary box, ESC returns to
# the table, Enter draws it again, and the second Enter confirms.
#
#   learn-table     the fixed level 1 page, left wall intact
#   learn-summary   the box: At your next full rest / Learn: Endure Cold
#                   (Arcane, L1) and Forget: Protection from Evil (Arcane, L1)
#   learn-table-back  the table after ESC, marks as they were
#   learn-summary-confirm  the same box, drawn again
#   saved           the session's ending, as spell-tags.keys leaves it

s

m
@dump:cast-menu
ESC

d
L
@dump:learn-table
DOWN*6
SPACE
UP*6
SPACE
ENTER
@dump:learn-summary
ESC
@dump:learn-table-back
ENTER
@dump:learn-summary-confirm
ENTER
ESC
ESC

ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
